{"id": 26, "ok": true, "cmd": "nthroots", "ucas": "nthroots 3 8", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "nthroots", "roots": [{"k": 0, "re": 2, "im": 0, "polar": "2", "exact": "2", "principal": true}, {"k": 1, "re": -0.9999999999999996, "im": 1.7320508075688774, "polar": "2*e^(i*2pi/3)", "exact": "-1 + i*sqrt(3)", "principal": false}, {"k": 2, "re": -1.0000000000000009, "im": -1.732050807568877, "polar": "2*e^(-i*2pi/3)", "exact": "-1 - i*sqrt(3)", "principal": false}], "headline": "the 3 cube roots of 8 (w^3 = 8)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each w^3, parsed back as printed, equals 8 numerically"}], "files": [], "text": "the 3 cube roots of 8 (w^3 = 8)\n  w0 = 2                      = 2  (principal)\n  w1 = -1 + i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(i*2pi/3)\n  w2 = -1 - i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(-i*2pi/3)\n  check: each w^3, parsed back as printed, equals 8 numerically\n"}
{"id": 27, "ok": true, "cmd": "unity", "ucas": "unity 4", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "unity", "roots": [{"k": 0, "re": 1, "im": 0, "polar": "1", "exact": "1", "principal": true}, {"k": 1, "re": 0, "im": 1, "polar": "e^(i*pi/2)", "exact": "i", "principal": false}, {"k": 2, "re": -1, "im": 0, "polar": "e^(i*pi)", "exact": "-1", "principal": false}, {"k": 3, "re": 0, "im": -1, "polar": "e^(-i*pi/2)", "exact": "-i", "principal": false}], "headline": "the 4 fourth roots of 1 (w^4 = 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each w^4, parsed back as printed, equals 1 numerically"}], "files": [], "text": "the 4 fourth roots of 1 (w^4 = 1)\n  w0 = 1                      = 1  (principal)\n  w1 = i                      = e^(i*pi/2)\n  w2 = -1                     = e^(i*pi)\n  w3 = -i                     = e^(-i*pi/2)\n  check: each w^4, parsed back as printed, equals 1 numerically\n"}
{"id": 28, "ok": true, "cmd": "implicit", "ucas": "implicit x^2 + y^2 = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "implicit", "var": "x", "function": "y", "derivative": "-x/y", "headline": "on the curve x^2 + y^2 - 1 = 0, y as a function of x:", "details": ["dy/dx = -F_x/F_y = -x/y", "holds where F_y = 2y != 0 (the implicit function theorem: there y is locally a differentiable function of x)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches the slope of the curve (points solved by bisection and Newton) at 12 points (max relative difference 2e-12)"}], "files": [], "text": "on the curve x^2 + y^2 - 1 = 0, y as a function of x:\n  dy/dx = -F_x/F_y = -x/y\n  holds where F_y = 2y != 0 (the implicit function theorem: there y is locally a differentiable function of x)\n  check: matches the slope of the curve (points solved by bisection and Newton) at 12 points (max relative difference 2e-12)\n"}
{"id": 29, "ok": true, "cmd": "integrate", "ucas": "integrate 1/z around |z| = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "contour_integral", "value": "2pi*i", "numerically": "the trapezoid rule on the circle with 1024 and 2048 points (difference 3e-18)", "residue_theorem": "2 pi i times the sum of the residues at the 1 pole inside = 2pi*i: agrees", "headline": "integral of 1/z around |z| = 1 (counterclockwise):"}, "notes": [{"kind": "assumed", "text": "z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\nintegral of 1/z around |z| = 1 (counterclockwise):\n  = 2pi*i\n  numerically: the trapezoid rule on the circle with 1024 and 2048 points (difference 3e-18)\n  residue theorem: 2 pi i times the sum of the residues at the 1 pole inside = 2pi*i: agrees\n"}
